Priyanka Chopra Jonas of Purple Pebble Pictures.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Evil Eye was released on October 13, 2020, by Amazon Studios, as the third
installment in the anthological Welcome to the Blumhouse film series.

